---
title: sd MF-01a: Client Creates and Submits a Job
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant FE as Web App (HRConnect-FE)
  participant API as JobEndpoints
  participant H as CreateJob / SubmitJob Handlers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  CL->>FE: Fill job form, MUST/SHOULD requirements & terms
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs (CreateJobCommand)
  API->>H: Send(CreateJobCommand)
  H->>DB: Verify Company is VERIFIED & ServiceType allowed
  H->>DB: Insert Job (DRAFT), JobRequirements & AuditLog
  H-->>API: Return JobDetailDto
  API-->>FE: 201 Created (JobDetailDto)
  CL->>FE: Click Submit Job for Review
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/submit (ConcurrencyToken)
  API->>H: Send(SubmitJobCommand)
  alt Missing MUST_HAVE requirement or stale ConcurrencyToken
    H-->>API: Throw BadRequest / ConflictException
    API-->>FE: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  else Valid Job Data
    H->>DB: Update Job -> PENDING_REVIEW, insert StatusHistory & AuditLog
    H-->>API: Return updated JobDetailDto
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Status: PENDING_REVIEW)
  end
